<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of March 7, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>					    March 7    WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  2,542  2,369  10,248</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				197    225     152</p>
<p>CCC						827    827   1,306</p>
<p>TOTAL					  3,566  3,421  11,706</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 2,087   1,902    unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     253     280    unq</p>
<p>CCC					  35,558   3,558    unq</p>
<p>TOTAL					 5,898   5,740    unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
